# arkraft-wiki settings

(Optional notes — anything below the frontmatter is for your reference only.)

## How it's used

When you invoke `/arkraft-wiki:wikify`, the skill reads `wiki_root` from this file
and hands the wiki authoring task off to `run-ralph:choo-choo` with wiki-specific
context (section taxonomy, harness checks, repo list).

If `wiki_root` is missing or the directory doesn't exist, the skill stops with
an actionable error — it won't guess a path.
